        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Prime Hardware MDS218U15, Magnetic Floor Mount Door Bumper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis magnetic floor mount door stop is typically used in residential and medium duty commercial applications. The 2-1/8\" high floor mounted door stop is made of zinc alloy and finished in Satin Nickel. The magnet is spring-loaded to absorb shocks. Packaged complete with all installation hardware including a heavy duty cement floor anchor for solid mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the MDS218U15 Satin Nickel Magnetic Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc Alloy</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height to Center of Magnet: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Size Length: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
